{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a31faf40a1d2c1f4c325ec993c581453407224ffdd21d7d8fad93004f72ca679", "ja": "（劇場でのお披露目公演に続き、単独ライブまで\n一気に駆け抜けた、『閃光☆HANABI団』……）", "zh": "（『闪光☆HANABI团』继首次在剧场亮相公演之后，\n接着又马不停蹄地举办单独演唱会……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1001_p", "source_sha256": "510ea8580ffe5aa234004ac9988d4b2afe4ac24cb7e695aae36be600dece1cbb", "ja": "（まさに、お祭りさながらの盛り上がりだった。\n夏の空に大輪の花が咲いたみたいだな！）", "zh": "（气氛简直就像祭典一样热烈，\n有如在夏日夜空大大绽放的花朵！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1003_p", "source_sha256": "68fa759b08d0fb1fc5c794e6b9a844b408b1043fab02f605fe3f381661723c7e", "ja": "あれ？　紗代子、まだ残ってたのか。", "zh": "咦？纱代子，你还没走啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "5e01b6091abc000a14bfcc5d6aac1d752a978cc572dfe74986b97076fd819f47", "ja": "はい。……{$P$}が\nまだ残っているのが見えたので、それで。", "zh": "是的……\n因为我看见{$P$}还留着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ed44151be0644654434a686cada78431b6161e0aae74f6e1eebc59abe2dcf9fe", "ja": "そうか。でもライブの後だ、疲れてるだろ？\n早く着替えて、今日のところは帰った方がいい。", "zh": "这样啊。不过演唱会刚结束，你应该很累吧？\n早点去换衣服，今天就先回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "39c008d853b3ecb2acb44f155a92f4d3b6eaee2fd9d12facfa0f8433da98978c", "ja": "そうですね。さすがにちょっと、体が重いです。\nでも、もう少しここにいたいなぁって……。", "zh": "是没错，我确实有点疲倦。\n不过，我想在这里多待一会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "04628cddbb9ed45e08b03ccd0912b7593e1fc98f9e5d03543958c12cd7c309ab", "ja": "すぐに帰ってしまうのが、なんだかもったいない\n気分なんです。……変ですよね？", "zh": "现在立刻就回去，总觉得很可惜……\n我很怪对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ffc045e09ff527571c4a093acda6ac8571252a79e1d4e2096086498cf1144eb5", "ja": "そんな事はないよ。楽しみの後は、終わるのが\n惜しい気分になるし……祭りのあと、とも言うしな。", "zh": "不会啊，欢乐过后就会有种舍不得结束的感觉……\n这就是祭典过后的余韵吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "570139ea2af9699946a0eabe4b9b4f35c2bc0adb685eb58f771d7f32bfe2f9df", "ja": "はい。でも、さみしいとかじゃないんです。\nえっと、なんて言えばいいのかな……？", "zh": "是啊，不过我不是感到寂寞。\n呃，该怎么说才好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "0b6be9811a6ec081bcf851e8e5ac493ac8443bf6fa7afd8d1eb06c6a1c44e7de", "ja": "私ひとりだったら、少しさみしいって思ったかも\nしれませんけど。でも、みんなと一緒だったし。", "zh": "要是只有我一个人，可能会觉得有点寂寞；\n但刚才是和大家一起度过嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "305eeddd1146a669daadbaf04bbcfe6e0f76d0a19e1d08bd0a62e0ff7fb0f398", "ja": "それに、{$P$}と一緒だったから\nなんだかすごく楽しかったな……って。", "zh": "而且，因为和{$P$}待在一起，\n所以我觉得过得非常开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1012_p", "source_sha256": "dc3d10240af99e7ec5dac09ca53b4ecad5d543ec23078c469e089efc3a9569a2", "ja": "それならよかった。\n色々手伝ってくれてありがとうな、紗代子。", "zh": "那就太好了。\n谢谢你帮了我很多忙，纱代子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "90e9d474977b577849d8c5300162bd21bf7a6db6545d055c842fa92aa530162c", "ja": "いいえ。私、本当に楽しかったですから。", "zh": "不会，因为我真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1014_p", "source_sha256": "59b55ebd3d334fefa3d9ad52455e119aaaf439dcd50edb85f7050b2666bef1f9", "ja": "そうか。", "zh": "这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "b60c0aa2c0c14534eacf418e84118a5fe662647a38c2e4c82b59742002d666f7", "ja": "あ……えっと。\nあの、{$P$}。", "zh": "啊……呃。\n那个，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "f627ea7719c4a223448e56d35df9c03b5f2c009c326107dddf14349d6500580b", "ja": "また、来年も……こうして、\n{$P$}と一緒に花火が見たいです。", "zh": "明年，我也想像这样……\n和{$P$}一起看烟火。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1017_p", "source_sha256": "957258aa1507218e3c44e895bddaf7c8645b91734207f3adaea8d977ad7f1c74", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。来年もまた見よう。\n約束だ！", "zh": "嗯，就是说啊。\n明年也要一起看，我们约好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "f2d25f7e51d472df31d22f43da621378345d5ebbef7f9c79da1ec48e7133f0a8", "ja": "あっ……そ、そうですね！\nあ、あの。その、みんなも一緒に、ですよね！", "zh": "啊……对、对啊！\n那、那个，你是指……和大家一起看，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0063_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "79dd62e3d21846d8901827662b5ffd123c26ac6a9d70ef21f93522b89d459110", "ja": "わ、私……着替えてきます！\n失礼しますっ。", "zh": "我、我……我去换衣服！\n先失陪了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
